dia.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_6f244388-f7ee-4ca3-afd9-8e08665b2cd1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>雪落林</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c39dffb7-670e-4169-8fa5-0c223e47e6b9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>干旱平原</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3859ba94-ac56-42b4-9ece-a358651186f1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>稀树草原林</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_4f2f6c17-022e-43f9-8fcb-45ff140d70e2.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>稀树草原</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c057ca1d-b84e-4aef-8346-e4d7a921799f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>沙漠（“绿洲”）</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_66ed1754-ee0b-475e-93c1-b9873e5ef0f8.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>风袭稀树草原</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_e855b668-c319-4d09-874c-cc9bb250a8e2.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>红树林沼泽</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1219645/description_0ba9fe77-55d2-4375-9474-adedd0a0a509.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>淹没雨林</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_d58ff4da-17e6-4d77-92ab-9da7bbcd7c30.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>蔚蓝海湾</strong></span></h3>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h