cdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_7dd6e75c-1fc1-4016-a6c8-141445104142.png\" alt=\"河口湿地\" width=\"800\" height=\"420\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>古白桦林</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_11483ffd-8ca7-4811-9b3f-e2bba90cf44d.png\" alt=\"白桦\" width=\"800\" height=\"420\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>温带铁杉雨林</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_79a2ab62-4857-436d-a5ed-c958453a36bf.png\" alt=\"针叶\" width=\"800\" height=\"420\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>黑森林</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_33ad1d4d-234b-4cb8-8f04-ff682c2af8f7.png\" alt=\"黑暗\" width=\"800\" height=\"420\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>火山原野与火山坡地</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0367143d-9c8e-41e3-9839-728030fe744d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_20ecc248-952b-403a-b89e-631f15ff3dd8.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>樱花林</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0149bfe9-47b4-49e3-980c-5163ae42cd88.png\" alt=\"樱花\" width=\"800\" height=\"420\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>盛花林</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_179bb52c-e6e2-4ef8-aa1d-af5dc175f029.png\" alt=\"繁花\"></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>垂枝林</strong></span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b19a97fc-2b10-4bc2-80cf-90f7bcdd473e.png\" alt=\"绿沼泽\" width=\"800\" height=\"420